   <indicator ascending="0" measure="5">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output Indicator</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1.	Number of local governments with more efficient and transparent system of funding of CSOs from public sources. 
2.	 Number of citizens receiving benefits and support from CSOs supported by the action.
3.	Internal project structures functional
4.	Number of meetings of project coordination advisory bodies held. 
5.	Number of local governments with institutionalized model of transparent and project-based funding of CSOs in the Western Balkan partners.
